what's he doing here top rope

00:13:32.780 --> 00:13:49.940
I really didn't know what they had in mind for me if they wanted me to just kind of play

00:13:49.940 --> 00:13:54.120
a more traditional role of what women had in the past or if they were gonna let me do

00:13:54.120 --> 00:14:00.000
some of the stuff that was fun for me to do and when they actually told me their idea

00:14:00.280 --> 00:14:02.770
moves.

00:14:02.770 --> 00:14:03.770
Are you serious?

