It's really neat.

00:14:05.660 --> 00:14:11.330
Well, she asked me a lot of things about how to do this.

00:14:11.330 --> 00:14:13.330
I tried to teach her.

00:14:13.330 --> 00:14:17.440
I did it first so that she saw how she made it easier.

00:14:17.440 --> 00:14:19.440
I always told her, "It's easy.

00:14:19.440 --> 00:14:20.440
It's easy."

00:14:20.440 --> 00:14:23.360
She told me, "It's easy for you, but for me, no."

00:14:23.360 --> 00:14:27.220
But she put all the effort and was doing things little by little.

00:14:27.220 --> 00:14:30.000
And she was the first women that started.

00:14:30.640 --> 00:14:32.610
to do spectacular things,

00:14:32.610 --> 00:14:34.700
things outside of what common.

00:14:34.700 --> 00:14:37.050
And I think that helps you a lot

00:14:37.050 --> 00:14:38.730
to get where you are.

00:14:38.730 --> 00:14:41.570
Both of us, really, very free-spirited.

00:14:41.570 --> 00:14:44.250
We might have just been out there for just a few minutes,

00:14:44.250 --> 00:14:46.370
but by God, those few minutes, we're going to be on fire

00:14:46.370 --> 00:14:48.340
the whole time we were out there.

00:14:48.340 --> 00:14:50.340
Well, I feel a great satisfaction

00:14:50.340 --> 00:14:53.490
