00:18:54.470 --> 00:18:57.350
We were still doing independent shows, and Lita was there.

00:18:57.350 --> 00:19:00.000
And when we met her, she was just getting started.

00:19:00.090 --> 00:19:03.210
I met those guys at an independent show that I was wrestling.

00:19:03.210 --> 00:19:05.430
It was like my third independent show.

00:19:05.430 --> 00:19:06.970
And I was all excited that they were there.

00:19:06.970 --> 00:19:08.270
I said, yeah, watch my match.

00:19:08.270 --> 00:19:10.140
And it was like horrible.

00:19:10.140 --> 00:19:11.720
It was like the worst match I've ever

00:19:11.720 --> 00:19:14.080
had of all three of my matches.

00:19:14.080 --> 00:19:15.240
We watched her match that night.

00:19:15.240 --> 00:19:17.460
And we seen her take some bumps.

00:19:17.460 --> 00:19:18.920
And they were really impressive.

00:19:18.920 --> 00:19:21.390
And we was like, whoa, she's got some potential.

00:19:21.390 --> 00:19:22.930
She's got what it takes.

00:19:22.930 --> 00:19:24.710
And that's when she started training with us.

00:19:24.710 --> 00:19:25.510
Matt was nice.

