00:19:43.740 --> 00:19:46.560
creative and learn some new stuff.

00:19:46.560 --> 00:19:48.780
And then we'd call it quits at sundown and go in and watch

00:19:48.780 --> 00:19:53.050
Sunday Night Heat and say, OK, yeah, we don't look like that.

00:19:53.050 --> 00:19:54.450
What can we do next week?

00:19:54.450 --> 00:19:58.390
Try to get one step closer to mirroring what we see on TV.

00:19:58.390 --> 00:20:00.000
You know, we kind of just taught her how to

00:20:00.280 --> 00:20:02.340
jump off buildings and stuff, you know?

00:20:02.340 --> 00:20:04.680
And we really clicked and became friends.

00:20:04.680 --> 00:20:08.220
When they first presented the idea of Lita joining Jeff and I,

00:20:08.220 --> 00:20:09.360
we both thought it was real cool.

00:20:09.360 --> 00:20:11.660
Lita's like a girl best friend to the Hardys.

00:20:11.660 --> 00:20:13.200
You know, she wasn't like a feminine figure

00:20:13.200 --> 00:20:15.420
where guys, you know, would look at us and say,

00:20:15.420 --> 00:20:16.460
"Oh, well, you know, they're soft.

00:20:16.460 --> 00:20:17.560
