00:22:51.380 --> 00:22:58.260
out of my mouth you know she puts her hands on my lips and pulls me into a beautiful classic moment

00:23:08.280 --> 00:23:14.130
That may have been my, that was probably the greatest kiss I've ever had in my life.

00:23:15.130 --> 00:23:20.330
Matt and Jeff are definitely the most important people in my life, inside and outside of the ring.

00:23:20.530 --> 00:23:22.210
They've always been there for me since day one.

00:23:22.310 --> 00:23:23.810
