00:23:24.390 --> 00:23:30.000
On a professional level, they help me more than anybody, but at the same time, it's really nice to know that we can go and

00:23:30.190 --> 00:23:34.640
Watch movies and eat pizza and talk about non-wrestling stuff, too.

00:23:34.640 --> 00:23:37.940
People actually ask me about the entrances a lot.

00:23:37.940 --> 00:23:40.550
And they'll say, "Oh, who told you to do this?"

00:23:40.550 --> 00:23:43.830
Or, "How'd you get the idea to do this?"

00:23:43.830 --> 00:23:45.970
