00:23:49.770 --> 00:23:52.080
The music plays, and then someone's back behind the curtain going,

00:23:52.080 --> 00:23:53.080
"Go! Now!"

00:23:53.080 --> 00:23:55.720
And you go, "Okay, okay."

00:23:55.720 --> 00:23:56.980
